  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-04-17T01:13:12.220Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Lately, I have found myself wanting to change my avatar cover pictures. To do so, a user must go into Unity, open the avatar project, and reupload/update the avatar they wish to change the picture of. This process is just fine, but with the new VCC update out- most of my projects are considered \"broken\" and will not let me update my avatars. It is also quite a tedious task if I wish to update all of my avatar pictures, as I have well over 50+ avatars. \n\nIt would be amazing if there was a possibility of adding an option where we would be able to change the avatar cover with any avatar on the https://vrchat.com/home/avatars page, similar to how you would update your in game profile picture and banner. Again, thank you so much for being so involved with the community and making the game so fun!",
